alse","unknown"]}},"required":["conditionId","value"],"additionalProperties":false}},"effect":{"type":"string","enum":["reachable","blocked","unknown"]},"explanation":{"type":"string"},"missingFacts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"factIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["id","assumptions","effect","explanation","missingFacts","factIds"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["obligationId","explanation","facts","decisiveMissingFacts","suggestedObservations","decision","branchResults"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["results"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"usage":{"input":4118,"output":1012,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"transportAttempts":"unknown","response":{"text":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_DK9LmGfeGC1U4YeSHAk483cq","name":"submit_authorization_result","arguments":{"results":[{"obligationId":"scenario%3Aadmin-other-memo::entry%3Acreate-share","decision":{"kind":"observed","observed":"allow"},"branchResults":[],"explanation":"At the declared entry boundary, the handler fetches the caller and rejects only a nil user before resolving the memo. It requires the memo to exist and be active, then applies access.CanManageMemo. That helper requires a non-nil memo and ownsOrAdministers, which requires an active actor and either actor.ID equal to the memo creator ID or actor.Role equal to store.RoleAdmin. Under the stated premise, the caller is an authenticated active instance ADMIN and the memo was authored by someone else, so the administrator branch passes. The handler separately rejects SPACE-audience memos; the stated non-SPACE premise passes that control. The protected effect is the Store.CreateMemoShare call, reached after these checks, with a write policy marked CreatingShare. Thus the source-visible authorization controls allow the administrator to proceed to share creation at declared entry. This conclusion does not assert that the store operation succeeds, that downstream conversion succeeds, or that concurrent state changes cannot affect later behavior.","facts":[{"id":"entry-handler","kind":"entry","statement":"CreateMemoShare fetches the current user and rejects an absent user as unauthenticated before proceeding.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9c7f468cb084f5da","startLine":25,"endLine":32}]},{"id":"principal-active-admin-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The authorization helper requires the actor to be active and accepts either ownership of the memo or the administrator role.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-34c8331239a9d018","startLine":83,"endLine":85}]},{"id":"resource-resolution","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler resolves the memo by UID and rejects a missing memo or a memo whose row status is not Normal.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9c7f468cb084f5da","startLine":37,"endLine":49}]},{"id":"author-or-admin-control","kind":"control","statement":"CreateMemoShare calls access.CanManageMemo and returns PermissionDenied when that author-or-administrator control fails.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9c7f468cb084f5da","startLine":51,"endLine":53}]},{"id":"can-manage-delegation","kind":"control","statement":"CanManageMemo requires a non-nil memo and delegates to ownsOrAdministers with the memo creator ID.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-34c8331239a9d018","startLine":73,"endLine":74}]},{"id":"space-audience-control","kind":"condition","statement":"The handler rejects memos with SpaceAudience and otherwise continues past the audience control.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9c7f468cb084f5da","startLine":54,"endLine":56}]},{"id":"protected-create-share-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After the authorization and audience checks, the handler constructs a share write policy, marks CreatingShare true, and calls Store.CreateMemoShare for the selected memo.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9c7f468cb084f5da","startLine":66,"endLine":75}]},{"id":"effect-error-separation","kind":"effect","statement":"An error returned by Store.CreateMemoShare is handled after the call and is not itself an authorization control at handler entry.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-9c7f468cb084f5da","startLine":76,"endLine":77}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":4118,"output":1012,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":36764.994000000064,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-29T08:02:47.479Z"}}
